---
config:
  layout: elk
---
flowchart TD
    A[Shipment packages received / Package收货扫描] --> B[Update package status / 更新Package状态]
    B --> C[Aggregate shipment receiving status / 汇总Shipment收货状态]

    C --> D{Shipment ready for scheduling? / Shipment是否可排线}
    D -->|No| E[Palletize / 打板]
    E --> F[Put away / 入库上架]
    F --> G[Waiting for scheduling / 等待排线]

    D -->|Yes| G

    G --> H[Generate schedule by shipment / 按Shipment生成Schedule]
    H --> I[Route optimization by shipment address / 按Shipment地址优化路线]

    I --> J{Assignment model / 分配模式}

    J -->|Direct driver| K[Assign schedule to driver / 分配给司机]
    J -->|DSP mode| L[Assign schedule to DSP / 分配给DSP]
    L --> M[DSP assigns driver / DSP分配司机]

    K --> N[Schedule assigned / Schedule已分配]
    M --> N

    N --> O[Driver pickup process / 司机提货流程]

    O --> P[Package pickup scan verification / Package级提货扫描校验]

    P --> Q{All shipments fully picked up? / 所有Shipment是否完整提货}
    Q -->|Yes| R[Schedule picked up / Schedule已提货]
    Q -->|No| S[Pickup exception / 提货异常]

    S --> T{Allow start with exception? / 是否允许异常开始}
    T -->|No| O
    T -->|Yes| U[Schedule picked up with exceptions / 带异常提货]

    R --> V[Out for delivery / 派送中]
    U --> V

    V --> W{All shipment results completed? / 所有Shipment是否有最终结果}
    W -->|Yes| X[Schedule completed / Schedule完成]
    W -->|No| Y[Schedule partially completed / Schedule部分完成]